<Positioned left="66" top="93.75999999999999" width="1120"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">A 220-Dobson contour, not an absence of ozone</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="116.25999999999999"><Text fontSize="12" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The Antarctic ozone hole is defined by a measurement threshold. Everything else in this issue depends on that definition.</Text></Positioned>
