<Positioned left="848" top="510.26"><Text fontSize="11" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">SHARE OF OZONE IN THE STRATOSPHERE</Text></Positioned>
