<Positioned left="848" top="792.42" width="328"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#8FA0BCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Ground-level UV-B drives sunburn and skin ca…</Text></Container></Positioned>
