<Positioned left="72" top="860.26"><Text fontSize="13" color="#38BDF8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1">WHY IT HAPPENS ONLY OVER THE POLE, ONLY IN SPRING</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="892.26"><Text fontSize="22" color="#7C6BF0FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">01</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="922.26"><Text fontSize="16" color="#F5F8FCFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">Polar night</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="946"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The vortex isolates air and it b</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="964"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">ecomes cold enough for clouds to</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="982"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL"> form in the dry stratosphere.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="338" top="892.26"><Container width="1" height="108" color="#25375FFF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="356" top="892.26"><Text fontSize="22" color="#7C6BF0FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">02</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="356" top="922.26"><Text fontSize="16" color="#F5F8FCFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">On the cloud surface</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="356" top="946"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Stable chlorine reservoirs are c</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="356" top="964"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">onverted into reactive forms suc</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="356" top="982"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">h as Cl₂.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="622" top="892.26"><Container width="1" height="108" color="#25375FFF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="640" top="892.26"><Text fontSize="22" color="#7C6BF0FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">03</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="640" top="922.26"><Text fontSize="16" color="#F5F8FCFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">Sunlight returns</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="640" top="946"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">UV splits Cl₂; free chlorine the</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="640" top="964"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">n destroys ozone catalytically —</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="640" top="982"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL"> one atom, thousands of molecule</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="640" top="1000"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">s.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="906" top="892.26"><Container width="1" height="108" color="#25375FFF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="924" top="892.26"><Text fontSize="22" color="#7C6BF0FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">04</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="924" top="922.26"><Text fontSize="16" color="#F5F8FCFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">Vortex breaks down</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="924" top="946"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Warm air mixes in, reactive chlo</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="924" top="964"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">rine disperses and the hole clos</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="924" top="982"><Text fontSize="13" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">es for the year.</Text></Positioned>
